  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "25",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "25",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko, mu mwaka ugira icenda Zedekiya ari ku ngoma, ku musi ugira cumi w’ukwezi kw’icumi, Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aja gutera Yerusalemu ajanye n’ingabo ziwe zose. Bacumbika inyuma y’igisagara, bacubakira ivyo kwuririrako ku mpande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igisagara kiguma cugarijwe gushika mu mwaka ugira cumi na rimwe Zedekiya ari ku ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi ugira icenda w’ukwezi kwa kane, inzara iba nyinshi mu gisagara gushika aho abantu babura ico batamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko, uruzitiro rw’igisagara bararusatura, maze mw’ijoro ingabo zose zirahunga ziciye mw’irembo riri hagati y’ibihome bibiri, hafi y’umurima w’umwami, naho Abanyababiloni bari bakikuje igisagara. Bahunga berekeye ikiyaya ca Yorodani citwa Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ingabo z’Abanyababiloni zikurikira umwami bamufatira mu kiyaya c’i Yeriko. Abasoda biwe bose barasanzara, baramuta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na we aca arafatwa, bamujana ku mwami w’i Babiloni yari i Ribula, aca amucira urubanza aho nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bicira abahungu ba Zedekiya imbere yiwe, na we bamunogora amaso, bamubohesha iminyororo, bamutwara i Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi ugira indwi w’ukwezi kwa gatanu mu mwaka ugira cumi n’icenda Nebukadineza ari umwami w’i Babiloni, ni ho Nebuzaradani umukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, akaba n’umwishikira w’umwami w’i Babiloni, yashika i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aturira Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ikirimba c’umwami, hamwe n’ayandi mazu yose yari i Yerusalemu. Inyubakwa zose zihambaye zo mu gisagara araziturira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasoda bose b’i Babiloni bari barongowe n’uwo mukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, baraza basenyura inzitiro zose z’i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradani umukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba, aca atwara mu kinyago abantu bose bari basigaye mu gisagara hamwe n’abasoda bari barishikanye ku mwami w’i Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko uwo mukuru w’ingabo zo ku kirimba, asiga bamwe mu bakene bo mu gihugu ngo bakorere imizabibu n’imirima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyababiloni basenyura za nkingi z’umwakaka hamwe na ca gikarabiro c’umwakaka n’ivyo cari giteretseko vyari mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", batwara n’umwakaka wabo i Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batwara n’udukono two kuyoreramwo umunyota, ivyo kuyoza umunyota, ibikombe, amapanu, hamwe n’ibindi bikoresho vyose vy’umwakaka vyakoreshwa mu Ngoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba atwara ibikoresho vyose vyari bikozwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza, harimwo amabesani n’ivyo guturirirako ibimota neza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwakaka wavuye muri za nkingi zibiri, ca gikarabiro bita ikiyaga na vya bitereko biterurwa, ivyo umwami Salomo yari yarakoze ngo bibe ivyo mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", vyari bifise uburemere butashobora gupimwa ku munzane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkingi imwe yose yapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi n’umunani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 8,1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’igihagararo. Umwashi w’umwakaka wari hejuru y’inkingi imwe wari ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 1,4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’uburebure ukaba usharijweko amakomamanga y’umwakaka awukikuje. Ku yindi nkingi, hari uwundi mwashi ufise amakomamanga yawo nk’uko nyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mukuru w’abasoda bo ku kirimba agira imbohe Seraya umuherezi mukuru, Zefaniya umuherezi wa kabiri hamwe n’abarinzi b’irembo batatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bari basigaye mu gisagara, atwara intwazangabo yatwara abasoda baja ku rugamba hamwe n’abahanuzi batanu b’umwami. Atwara n’umunyamabanga yari ajejwe kwinjiza abantu mu gisoda, hamwe n’abandi banyagihugu mirongo itandatu yasanze mu gisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ntwazangabo Nebuzaradani ica ifata ba bantu bose ibashira umwami w’i Babiloni i Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca abicira aho nyene i Ribula mu ntara y’i Hamati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko Abayuda batwawe mu kinyago, bakurwa mu gihugu cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni aca agena Gedaliya mwene Ahikamu, Ahikamu mwene Shafani, ngo abe umutware w’abantu bari basigaye i Buyuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze intwazangabo zose n’abantu babo bumvise ko umwami w’i Babiloni yagenye Gedaliya ngo abe umukuru w’iyo ntara, baca baja kubonana na Gedaliya i Misipa. Abo na bo ni Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Yohanani na Yonatani bene Kareya, Seraya mwene Tanihumeti, bene Efayi Umunetofati, na Yazaniya umuhungu w’Umumayaka, n’abantu babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya aca arabarahira, arabahumuriza hamwe n’abantu babo ababwira ati: “Ntimutinye abatware b’Abanyababiloni. Nimugende mube amahoro mu gihugu, muyoboke umwami w’i Babiloni, ibindi vyose bizogenda neza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko mu kwezi kugira indwi, Ishimayeli mwene Netaniya, Netaniya mwene Elishama, wo mu muryango w’abami, azanana n’abasoda cumi, bica Gedaliya ari kumwe n’Abayuda, n’Abanyababiloni i Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abantu bose b’i Buyuda, uhereye kuri muto ugashika kuri mukuru, bari kumwe n’abakuru mu ngabo, baterwa n’ubwoba bw’Abanyababiloni, bahungira muri Egiputa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
